WEBVTT

00:00:20.583 --> 00:00:24.917
A long time ago, in a remote part
of Europe, in a place called "Vigrid"...

00:00:24.917 --> 00:00:29.375
...lived those who were known
as the observers of history.

00:00:29.375 --> 00:00:32.750
The Umbra Witches, the followers of darkness.

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:36.833
And the Lumen Sages, the followers of the light.

00:00:36.833 --> 00:00:41.500
The witches were in league with demons
and the sages were allied with angels...

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:44.000
...they were responsible
for protecting the world...

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.917
...by keeping the right balance between them.

00:00:47.917 --> 00:00:51.375
However, the balance was lost suddenly.

00:00:51.375 --> 00:00:56.250
It started because a sage and a witch
violated the decrees that bound them...

00:00:56.250 --> 00:01:00.667
...and produced a child.

00:01:00.667 --> 00:01:04.750
The woman was imprisoned
and the man was banished...

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:08.292
...but that was only the beginning.

00:01:08.292 --> 00:01:13.708
"The intersection of light and
dark will bring calamity to this earth."

00:01:13.708 --> 00:01:19.625
That legend had become reality.

00:01:19.625 --> 00:01:26.292
Right Eye and Left Eye
govern the power of creation.

00:01:26.292 --> 00:01:33.375
The forbidden child, who the witches took
charge of, possessed the powers of Left Eye.

00:01:33.375 --> 00:01:35.625
When the two eyes are brought together...

00:01:35.625 --> 00:01:41.375
...the Creator Jubileus will be made
incarnate and a New World will be created.

00:01:41.375 --> 00:01:46.500
This is heaven's will and heaven's order.

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:51.792
The sages were on heaven's side,
the witches were against them...

00:01:51.792 --> 00:01:57.958
...resulting in a conflict over Left Eye.

00:01:57.958 --> 00:02:02.750
The conflict grew and grew until it became a
full-blown war between angels and demons...

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:06.208
...and the world was sent
hurtling towards destruction.

00:02:08.292 --> 00:02:12.667
The sages and the witches died out
in droves, and the war came to an end.

00:02:12.667 --> 00:02:18.042
The truth of their existences
slipped into obscurity.

00:02:18.042 --> 00:02:20.917
The forbidden child grew up to be a witch...

00:02:20.917 --> 00:02:26.667
...but she was hidden away
and sealed in a secret place...

00:02:26.667 --> 00:02:30.292
500 years later...

00:02:30.292 --> 00:02:34.833
The witch, who hunts angels, has returned...

00:02:51.375 --> 00:02:54.875
"Mass suicide in Ragna church."

00:03:28.042 --> 00:03:29.958
Fleur de Cirey...

00:03:47.625 --> 00:03:50.458
I am the way into the city of woe.

00:03:50.458 --> 00:03:53.250
I am the way to a forsaken people.

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:56.083
I am the way into eternal sorrow.

00:03:56.083 --> 00:04:00.000
Abandon all hope ye who enter here.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:02.792
I am the way into the city of woe.

00:04:02.792 --> 00:04:05.750
I am the way to a forsaken people.

00:04:05.750 --> 00:04:09.167
I am the way into eternal sorrow.

00:04:09.167 --> 00:04:13.125
Abandon all hope ye who enter here.

00:04:22.208 --> 00:04:24.292
What's going on?

00:05:57.333 --> 00:06:00.792
This time, I'll reveal her
for who she really is.

00:06:15.167 --> 00:06:20.625
Look what you've done to
my outfit. You're so impatient.

00:06:48.875 --> 00:06:53.958
You presume too much.
I'm not the partner you seek.

00:06:56.708 --> 00:06:59.792
It was a wonderful performance, Rodin.

00:06:59.792 --> 00:07:02.375
But of course, Bayonetta.

00:07:02.375 --> 00:07:06.292
By the way... is my Knight ready?

00:07:06.292 --> 00:07:10.625
Whether you'll like him or not is another thing.

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:24.542
The Elfin Knight.

00:07:24.542 --> 00:07:27.292
It is a good name for a knight's weapon.

00:07:40.958 --> 00:07:43.792
The fun's only just started.

00:08:18.625 --> 00:08:20.917
What's going on?

00:08:47.083 --> 00:08:49.375
Beautiful!

00:09:03.417 --> 00:09:05.458
My car!

00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:11.750
I'm still paying the loan.

00:09:32.667 --> 00:09:34.625
This is bad!

00:09:38.542 --> 00:09:43.500
I must become the cornerstone of Left Eye.

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:48.250
Unleash all your powers of darkness.

00:09:48.250 --> 00:09:50.458
What are you talking about?

00:10:02.708 --> 00:10:06.125
The Creator will soon return.

00:10:06.125 --> 00:10:08.833
You're wasting your time.

00:10:14.375 --> 00:10:17.250
What's going on here?

00:10:45.125 --> 00:10:50.417
My infernal partner is telling me he's hungry!

00:10:51.167 --> 00:10:56.792
He'd be quite satisfied with a catch like you.

00:11:08.833 --> 00:11:12.625
It's dinnertime, my sweet.

00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:24.458
Oh, I forgot. There's another
reason why I'm hunting you.

00:11:24.458 --> 00:11:29.250
I take pleasure from watching
your face distort with pain.

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:33.292
Transform the world into what it should be...

00:11:33.292 --> 00:11:36.875
That's the face I was talking about.

00:11:36.875 --> 00:11:39.000
It gets me so excited!!

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:43.833
Glory be to the Creator Jubileus!

00:12:02.583 --> 00:12:04.958
You put on quite a show.

00:12:08.167 --> 00:12:11.333
Did you like the Knight?

00:12:15.167 --> 00:12:17.792
Not bad.

00:12:17.792 --> 00:12:21.375
It'll do as a sidekick for a while.

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:25.292
Time to open the bar.

00:12:27.083 --> 00:12:29.250
I'll be waiting.

00:12:29.250 --> 00:12:31.458
If I can be bothered.

00:12:32.875 --> 00:12:37.708
I'll prepare Mysterious Destiny with an olive.

00:12:50.792 --> 00:12:54.292
I thought it was a mouse.
But it was you, Cheshire.

00:12:54.292 --> 00:12:58.875
The name's Luka. It's about time you remembered.

00:12:58.875 --> 00:13:00.625
What is it?

00:13:01.583 --> 00:13:05.000
Guys who stalk the ladies never get the girl.

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:08.375
I wouldn't worry. I've got the looks.

00:13:08.375 --> 00:13:13.875
Claire, Trish, Sylvia, and
Ammy are all crazy about me.

00:13:13.875 --> 00:13:17.333
I'm impressed you have so many friends.

00:13:17.333 --> 00:13:21.333
But it's not nice to be a peeping Tom.

00:13:21.333 --> 00:13:22.875
Such a bad boy.

00:13:24.417 --> 00:13:27.792
Stop it! That's professional equipment.

00:13:27.792 --> 00:13:33.042
Not to mention, you made a huge dent in my car!

00:13:33.042 --> 00:13:35.375
Did I?

00:13:37.125 --> 00:13:41.708
Did it conveniently slip your mind again?

00:13:44.083 --> 00:13:49.292
I'll never forget what happened 20 years ago.

00:13:49.292 --> 00:13:51.250
Fleur de Cirey.

00:13:51.250 --> 00:13:54.958
I'll always remember the smell.

00:13:57.083 --> 00:14:03.417
The same smell from the day
my father died... the day I first saw you.

00:14:20.625 --> 00:14:22.250
Father!

00:14:23.458 --> 00:14:25.583
Father...

00:14:25.583 --> 00:14:28.125
As a journalist...

00:14:29.167 --> 00:14:32.000
I'll expose you for who you are.

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:33.958
That's a turn on.

00:14:33.958 --> 00:14:35.500
Remember this.

00:14:35.500 --> 00:14:39.250
You can disappear,
but I'll know you by your scent.

00:14:39.250 --> 00:14:42.750
The famous perfume, Fleur de Cirey.

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:46.833
The sweet essence of rosemary.

00:14:46.833 --> 00:14:49.167
It doesn't suit you.

00:14:49.167 --> 00:14:52.792
You don't know that much
about perfume do you, Cheshire?

00:14:52.792 --> 00:14:54.083
My name's Luka!

00:14:54.083 --> 00:14:58.167
Rosemary isn't used in Fleur de Cirey.

00:14:58.167 --> 00:15:00.500
I wear it to ward off evil spirits.

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:05.333
A witch with a perfume to
ward off evil? That's a laugh.

00:15:05.333 --> 00:15:07.375
They heard the commotion.

00:15:07.375 --> 00:15:09.792
See you, Cheshire.

00:15:09.792 --> 00:15:11.958
Bayonetta, wait!

00:15:13.542 --> 00:15:15.583
This isn't good.

00:15:17.750 --> 00:15:20.583
The reawakening is close.

00:16:04.208 --> 00:16:05.833
Good girl.

00:16:06.875 --> 00:16:11.667
There are demons in places like this.
You should go somewhere safer.

00:16:24.792 --> 00:16:28.292
I am here in front of the
Ithavoll Tower, in Vigrid...

00:16:28.292 --> 00:16:30.625
...a sacred site of the Ragna.

00:16:30.625 --> 00:16:36.583
This year, the 500-year wait for the return of
the Creator Jubileus is meant to come to an end.

00:16:36.583 --> 00:16:41.875
Believers all around the world
are joyously celebrating his coming.

00:16:41.875 --> 00:16:48.042
Meanwhile, however, we continue to hear of
believers committing suicide "to aid the resurrection."

00:16:48.042 --> 00:16:50.500
Only yesterday a head priest of the Ragna...

00:16:50.500 --> 00:16:54.500
...committed suicide with over 20 believers.

00:16:54.500 --> 00:17:00.542
Unknown parties later partially
destroyed the cathedral housing their bodies.

00:17:00.542 --> 00:17:04.875
This has prompted many countries
to pronounce states of emergency...

00:17:04.875 --> 00:17:09.083
...and believers of Ragna
have been asked to remain calm.

00:17:09.083 --> 00:17:13.417
The supreme leader of the Ithavoll Group,
who effectively governs this sacred city...

00:17:13.417 --> 00:17:16.917
...is preparing to appear
in public for the first time.

00:17:16.917 --> 00:17:19.625
The humans are panicking.

00:17:19.625 --> 00:17:21.167
It's pathetic!

00:17:21.167 --> 00:17:25.458
Sacrificing themselves for
the resurrection of some god?

00:17:25.458 --> 00:17:31.125
But it's thanks to these
idiots that I'm in business.

00:17:31.125 --> 00:17:35.417
You're overcharging for
the funerals you're taking on.

00:17:35.417 --> 00:17:38.333
You're not such a good guy, either.

00:17:38.333 --> 00:17:43.042
I'm a good guy. As long as I'm making money!

00:17:43.042 --> 00:17:49.417
Anyone with a conscience wouldn't
want to handle these crazy believers.

00:17:49.417 --> 00:17:54.792
When you look at it,
I'm quite the philanthropist.

00:17:54.792 --> 00:17:58.792
If that's the case,
you should be donating to the Church.

00:17:58.792 --> 00:18:02.708
And you owe me my reward.

00:18:02.708 --> 00:18:06.750
Don't make me laugh. You enjoy killing angels.

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:11.292
You take pleasure in it, right?
Isn't that enough?

00:18:11.292 --> 00:18:14.583
Hey, wait. Slow down.

00:18:14.583 --> 00:18:15.917
I'm sorry?

00:18:15.917 --> 00:18:21.417
Shit!! You're the one
that trashed the cathedral.

00:18:21.417 --> 00:18:25.792
So I say goodbye to any profit.
Consider my position!

00:18:25.792 --> 00:18:28.333
I offer my condolences.

00:18:28.333 --> 00:18:32.625
But the deal was information in
exchange for a troublesome funeral.

00:18:32.625 --> 00:18:34.542
Yeah, yeah.

00:18:34.542 --> 00:18:40.500
You're damn bossy for someone
who can't even remember her own name.

00:18:40.500 --> 00:18:43.458
Her name is Bayonetta.

00:18:43.458 --> 00:18:46.917
That's the name you gave her.

00:18:46.917 --> 00:18:50.917
It's been 20 years since she awoke
from her coffin at the bottom of that lake.

00:18:50.917 --> 00:18:56.250
But she's still one big mystery--the only
thing she remembers is that she's a witch.

00:18:56.250 --> 00:19:00.333
Killing angels and offering
them up to demons is great and all,

00:19:00.333 --> 00:19:04.000
but she might as well do work
more likely to make some money--

00:19:04.000 --> 00:19:07.250
Men who blabber lead short lives.

00:19:09.125 --> 00:19:14.458
And here he is. Mr. Balder,
the leader of the Ithavoll Group.

00:19:14.458 --> 00:19:21.125
It's fair to say that the Group's vast
fortune supports the economy of Vigrid.

00:19:21.125 --> 00:19:25.250
If Mr. Balder, revered by
his followers, tackles this well...

00:19:25.250 --> 00:19:27.417
Oh, that's him!

00:19:27.417 --> 00:19:31.375
I'll give you the lowdown on him as your reward.

00:19:31.375 --> 00:19:34.500
He's the head of the Ragna.

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:38.292
Apparently, it's the first time
he's shown his face in public.

00:19:38.292 --> 00:19:42.583
This coincides with the
first resurrection in 500 years.

00:19:42.583 --> 00:19:47.208
Some say he has been alive
since the last resurrection.

00:19:47.208 --> 00:19:50.042
If that's the truth, he's not human.

00:19:50.042 --> 00:19:54.833
The Ithavoll Group has cutting-edge
technology that ain't exactly in keeping

00:19:54.833 --> 00:19:57.417
with the "good old religious hub" image.

00:19:57.417 --> 00:20:01.000
The believers see technology as a holy miracle.

00:20:01.000 --> 00:20:09.583
According to informants, Balder is
a descendent of the long lost sages...

00:20:09.583 --> 00:20:14.000
...the votaries of light and enemy
of the witches spoken of in folklore.

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:17.958
A modern day sage...

00:20:17.958 --> 00:20:21.542
A tasty snippet of info, right?

00:20:28.458 --> 00:20:32.667
I'm waiting, my dear child.

00:20:36.083 --> 00:20:39.708
She seems happy with the reward.

00:20:41.375 --> 00:20:42.958
I am going home.

00:20:42.958 --> 00:20:46.625
My sons are going to throw me a birthday party.

00:20:46.625 --> 00:20:49.333
Not paying for your drinks again?

00:20:49.333 --> 00:20:54.792
That's your birthday present, right? Thank you.

00:20:54.792 --> 00:20:59.042
I'll contact you when I get a job.

00:20:59.042 --> 00:21:02.583
Freaky undertaker.

00:21:02.583 --> 00:21:04.708
Ciao!

00:21:14.583 --> 00:21:18.458
You were holding that when you awoke.

00:21:18.458 --> 00:21:19.750
Yes.

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:23.167
It doesn't help you to remember?

00:21:23.167 --> 00:21:25.375
Well...

00:21:25.375 --> 00:21:31.583
At the moment, that man,
Balder, interests me more.

00:21:31.583 --> 00:21:36.625
He holds the key to my lost memory.

00:21:36.625 --> 00:21:40.917
Is that what Enzo's info told you?

00:21:43.417 --> 00:21:46.792
Call it woman's intuition.

00:21:46.792 --> 00:21:49.042
So you're going to Vigrid?

00:21:49.042 --> 00:21:50.750
Yes.

00:21:58.750 --> 00:22:01.958
Take whatever you want.

00:22:20.875 --> 00:22:25.583
I've waited 500 years for this time to come.

00:22:25.583 --> 00:22:29.417
The girl will find her way here in the end.

00:22:29.417 --> 00:22:34.875
And will history repeat itself? Or...

00:22:34.875 --> 00:22:39.417
Her path is predestined. And I'll tell you why.

00:22:39.417 --> 00:22:46.042
I understand the rules of
the three worlds. I see it all.

00:22:46.042 --> 00:22:52.042
Our actions will help in the
reconstruction of the supreme world.

00:22:52.042 --> 00:22:56.167
It's ironic that Right Eye
should choose chaos over order.

00:22:56.167 --> 00:22:59.708
You're wrong. The world is already in chaos.

00:22:59.708 --> 00:23:02.917
My daughter and I must
become the Eyes of the World.

00:23:02.917 --> 00:23:09.708
Until the three worlds form a perfect whole,
there will be no true order, no true salvation.

00:23:09.708 --> 00:23:12.083
The logic of a madman.

00:23:12.083 --> 00:23:15.375
You don't have the capacity to understand.

00:23:15.375 --> 00:23:19.250
How unfortunate that you cannot part with me.

00:23:19.250 --> 00:23:23.917
The angels are working hard for me.

00:23:23.917 --> 00:23:27.917
You too, Jeanne.

00:23:30.083 --> 00:23:32.458
We've waited 500 years.

00:23:32.458 --> 00:23:37.042
You must be looking forward to seeing her again.

00:23:37.042 --> 00:23:42.542
Everything we do is to prepare for
the coming of the Creator, Jubileus.

00:23:44.958 --> 00:23:49.042
The Creation of a New World draws close.

00:24:02.875 --> 00:24:05.833
The data's intact...

00:24:06.833 --> 00:24:11.458
Yet I still couldn't capture her true form.

00:24:12.458 --> 00:24:16.167
Where will I find you next, Bayonetta?

00:24:23.292 --> 00:24:27.250
Ragna... the descendent of the sages...

00:24:32.208 --> 00:24:37.917
When my father tried to uncover
the truth about the sages and witches...

00:24:37.917 --> 00:24:40.750
Bayonetta killed him.

00:25:03.250 --> 00:25:09.000
Awaken, dear daughter!

00:25:13.417 --> 00:25:15.667
Daddy?

00:25:15.667 --> 00:25:19.208
Yes... come here.

00:26:08.792 --> 00:26:11.917
Excuse me, but who are you?

00:26:31.208 --> 00:26:34.583
You possess the same magic powers as me.

00:26:34.583 --> 00:26:38.250
I'm going to ask you again. Who are you?

00:26:39.292 --> 00:26:43.917
Your extended sleep seems
to have dulled your senses.

00:26:43.917 --> 00:26:49.833
Have I met you before?
You seem to know who I am.

00:26:49.833 --> 00:26:53.417
I may know that better than you do.

00:26:53.417 --> 00:26:55.667
I'm even more curious.

00:26:55.667 --> 00:26:59.458
If you can defeat me, I'll explain.

00:27:09.417 --> 00:27:11.792
The fun's just begun.

00:27:30.708 --> 00:27:36.458
I remember this. What about you?

00:27:36.458 --> 00:27:38.250
Thanks for your concern.

00:27:38.250 --> 00:27:42.333
I get the feeling I'll remember
once I've knocked you down.

00:27:42.333 --> 00:27:44.250
You're so slow.

00:28:28.833 --> 00:28:32.750
Is that all you have?

00:28:32.750 --> 00:28:37.875
I don't know. I think I have a
few other tricks up my sleeve.

00:28:37.875 --> 00:28:41.583
What else can you do with that toy?

00:28:41.583 --> 00:28:45.167
I'll show you. You still want to play, right?

00:28:48.583 --> 00:28:50.583
You must be kidding...

00:28:50.583 --> 00:28:53.250
We're not getting anywhere.

00:29:38.625 --> 00:29:41.542
Hey, Daddy. Is Mummy here?

00:29:41.542 --> 00:29:47.750
If you're a good girl,
Mummy will come for you very soon.

00:29:47.750 --> 00:29:50.042
Cereza's a good girl!

00:29:50.042 --> 00:29:53.292
You can wait on your own?

00:29:53.292 --> 00:29:54.542
Of course!

00:30:05.708 --> 00:30:09.750
Cheshire. It's okay, right?

00:30:09.750 --> 00:30:13.500
Please come quickly, Mummy.

00:30:40.792 --> 00:30:44.042
I don't recall this bar being here.

00:30:44.042 --> 00:30:46.417
It's a temporary outpost.

00:30:46.417 --> 00:30:50.333
Isn't there something you want to tell me?

00:30:50.333 --> 00:30:55.208
They sure didn't live up to
the "Knight" name, did they?

00:30:55.208 --> 00:30:58.125
What did you do to them?

00:30:58.125 --> 00:31:02.000
All I did was have a shootout with some bitch.

00:31:03.667 --> 00:31:06.042
You were shooting at yourself?

00:31:08.042 --> 00:31:09.917
I'll repair them.

00:31:09.917 --> 00:31:13.083
Make them a little tougher next time.

00:31:15.542 --> 00:31:17.833
Fancy a drink?

00:31:17.833 --> 00:31:24.542
I'm in a hurry. I look forward
to a more satisfactory Knight.

00:31:41.625 --> 00:31:44.917
Mummy, where are you?

00:31:44.917 --> 00:31:47.500
Mummy...

00:31:58.458 --> 00:32:03.667
Rodin's not the only one
who wants me to take a detour.

00:32:03.667 --> 00:32:06.458
Where am I exactly?

00:32:06.458 --> 00:32:10.375
It's no party spot.

00:32:10.375 --> 00:32:14.458
Mummy! Mummy!

00:32:18.417 --> 00:32:21.167
Mummy?

00:32:21.167 --> 00:32:23.500
Mummy!

00:32:23.500 --> 00:32:26.542
Mummy! Mummy!

00:32:29.167 --> 00:32:31.083
A ghost!

00:32:31.083 --> 00:32:33.458
Can you see angels?

00:32:41.708 --> 00:32:45.042
Mummy! Mummy!

00:32:46.208 --> 00:32:48.458
This is troublesome!

00:33:08.833 --> 00:33:13.125
You want to play, huh? Let me oblige.

00:33:34.208 --> 00:33:37.167
Cheshire! Cheshire!

00:33:37.167 --> 00:33:38.792
Cheshire?

00:33:49.500 --> 00:33:51.250
Mummy!

00:33:51.250 --> 00:33:53.542
Stop crying.

00:33:53.542 --> 00:33:57.208
I hate crybabies as much as I hate cockroaches.

00:33:57.208 --> 00:34:00.583
And I'm not your mother!

00:34:00.583 --> 00:34:02.000
Okay.

00:34:02.000 --> 00:34:03.875
Mummy...

00:34:06.875 --> 00:34:08.958
You take cover, little one.

00:34:08.958 --> 00:34:12.667
An angel seeks my attention.

00:34:12.667 --> 00:34:17.542
But it doesn't seem to
want to harm this little girl.

00:34:17.542 --> 00:34:23.208
Tell me why you went to
the trouble of bringing me here.

00:34:23.208 --> 00:34:25.625
We're going to be safe, right?

00:34:25.625 --> 00:34:29.667
I must become the cornerstone of resurrection.

00:34:29.667 --> 00:34:32.000
Come on. Let's dance!

00:34:38.917 --> 00:34:41.125
I'm going to enjoy this.

00:34:59.083 --> 00:35:01.417
Mummy!

00:35:10.708 --> 00:35:13.583
You find me that engaging?

00:35:13.583 --> 00:35:16.500
You want to take me by force?

00:35:17.583 --> 00:35:18.917
Bad boy!

00:35:18.917 --> 00:35:23.125
It seems I'll have to teach you a lesson!

00:35:35.667 --> 00:35:40.292
Come on, then. Let's dance, baby!!

00:35:42.167 --> 00:35:45.625
Glory be to the Creator Jubileus!

00:36:08.917 --> 00:36:12.333
Mummy! Mummy!

00:36:14.292 --> 00:36:16.542
What's your name, little one?

00:36:16.542 --> 00:36:18.250
Cereza.

00:36:18.250 --> 00:36:20.667
Have you forgotten, Mummy?

00:36:20.667 --> 00:36:24.208
I probably won't remember you later, either.

00:36:24.208 --> 00:36:26.750
What are you doing in such a dreadful place?

00:36:26.750 --> 00:36:32.000
Daddy told me to wait here for Mummy.

00:36:32.000 --> 00:36:34.042
He left you alone?

00:36:34.042 --> 00:36:37.458
I'm not alone. Cheshire's here.

00:36:37.458 --> 00:36:39.458
You were crying like a baby.

00:36:39.458 --> 00:36:42.042
Mummy, let's go home.

00:36:42.042 --> 00:36:46.667
How many times do I have
to tell you? I'm not your mother.

00:36:46.667 --> 00:36:49.333
Your father will be back soon.

00:36:49.333 --> 00:36:52.792
But I want to stay with you, Mummy.

00:36:54.833 --> 00:36:56.917
This is awkward.

00:37:05.458 --> 00:37:06.833
Come here.

00:37:08.083 --> 00:37:10.208
Okay, Mummy!

00:37:10.958 --> 00:37:12.417
Ouch!

00:37:15.542 --> 00:37:17.792
You're very clumsy.

00:37:42.750 --> 00:37:44.500
What is it, Mummy?

00:37:44.500 --> 00:37:46.625
Little one, what's this?

00:37:46.625 --> 00:37:50.875
You gave it to me for my birthday, Mummy.

00:37:54.667 --> 00:37:56.292
No more falling over.

00:37:56.292 --> 00:37:57.792
Okay!

00:38:00.750 --> 00:38:02.333
Hold on tight!

00:38:02.333 --> 00:38:03.792
Okay, Mummy!

00:38:03.792 --> 00:38:05.042
And no more "Mummy."

00:38:05.042 --> 00:38:07.250
Okay, Mummy!

00:38:42.667 --> 00:38:46.583
It's been forever since we
took a bath together! This is fun!

00:38:46.583 --> 00:38:48.083
Honestly!

00:38:48.083 --> 00:38:51.333
You nagged me into it.

00:38:58.583 --> 00:39:01.208
You don't live with your mother?

00:39:01.208 --> 00:39:06.583
You know I don't. I've lived on my own for ages.

00:39:06.583 --> 00:39:08.750
Your mother hates crybabies, too.

00:39:08.750 --> 00:39:11.542
But I'm not a crybaby!

00:39:11.542 --> 00:39:15.042
Mummy! Why didn't you come to see me?

00:39:15.042 --> 00:39:17.417
Why did you leave me alone?

00:39:17.417 --> 00:39:19.625
I don't know.

00:39:19.625 --> 00:39:23.083
Because I'm not your mother.

00:39:23.083 --> 00:39:25.292
I hate you!

00:39:28.917 --> 00:39:31.375
You were all alone?

00:39:32.500 --> 00:39:34.042
Any friends?

00:39:34.042 --> 00:39:35.542
Cheshire.

00:39:48.583 --> 00:39:52.125
It's so pretty! Just like snow!

00:39:53.000 --> 00:39:55.208
What a pushover...

00:40:02.000 --> 00:40:05.250
I don't recall asking for room service.

00:40:05.250 --> 00:40:08.917
You should think about your methods.
Someone could sue.

00:40:09.292 --> 00:40:12.833
Not so many methods to choose from with a witch.

00:40:12.833 --> 00:40:14.292
Oh!

00:40:15.292 --> 00:40:18.083
Who is he?

00:40:18.083 --> 00:40:19.958
Cheshire... No.

00:40:19.958 --> 00:40:23.958
He's a perverted old guy who photographs ladies.

00:40:23.958 --> 00:40:25.333
Pervert?

00:40:25.333 --> 00:40:26.625
Mummy?

00:40:26.625 --> 00:40:29.292
You have a daughter?

00:40:29.292 --> 00:40:31.958
Of course not.

00:40:31.958 --> 00:40:35.875
But the process of making a baby interests me.

00:40:37.750 --> 00:40:40.333
Well, I'm not interested...

00:40:41.167 --> 00:40:44.292
Not interested... at all...

00:40:44.292 --> 00:40:48.333
Not... interested...

00:40:48.333 --> 00:40:49.542
...at all!

00:40:49.542 --> 00:40:52.125
Oh! He fell!

00:40:52.125 --> 00:40:54.292
Is the old guy dead?

00:40:54.292 --> 00:40:58.250
No ghost is coming to
fetch him, so he must be alive.

00:40:58.250 --> 00:41:00.167
Unfortunately.

00:41:03.042 --> 00:41:06.208
I'm not an old guy.

00:41:35.542 --> 00:41:37.417
Asleep already?

00:41:37.417 --> 00:41:39.417
You're very persistent.

00:41:39.417 --> 00:41:44.042
How much longer do you intend to hang
around with that toy of yours, Cheshire?

00:41:44.042 --> 00:41:45.583
The name's Luka.

00:41:51.250 --> 00:41:55.792
Bayonetta, what's happening in this city?

00:41:55.792 --> 00:41:57.250
I don't care.

00:41:57.250 --> 00:41:59.917
Why are you here, then?

00:41:59.917 --> 00:42:01.750
It's none of your business.

00:42:03.292 --> 00:42:07.042
It's everything to do with me...
you killed my father.

00:42:07.042 --> 00:42:10.083
I've heard enough of that assumption.

00:42:10.083 --> 00:42:12.542
Don't play innocent with me.

00:42:12.542 --> 00:42:14.667
My father was a journalist...

00:42:14.667 --> 00:42:21.458
...who devoted his life to solving
the mystery of the sages and the witches.

00:42:22.000 --> 00:42:28.625
Though he probably never
dreamed he'd be killed by a witch...

00:42:28.625 --> 00:42:34.167
By revealing your identity,
perhaps I can uncover the truth he sought.

00:42:34.167 --> 00:42:38.458
According to his notes, about 500 years ago...

00:42:38.458 --> 00:42:42.458
...the sages and the witches
suddenly disappeared...

00:42:42.458 --> 00:42:45.500
...and their legend was lost.

00:42:45.500 --> 00:42:49.875
However, the witch, Bayonetta,
reappeared 20 years ago.

00:42:49.875 --> 00:42:53.875
And now a descendent of the sages,
Balder, has come forward.

00:42:53.875 --> 00:42:58.125
It must have something
to do with the resurrection.

00:42:58.125 --> 00:43:00.375
You're going to see Balder, right?

00:43:00.375 --> 00:43:03.292
Possibly...

00:43:03.292 --> 00:43:08.583
You'll understand why you killed
my father when you regain your memory.

00:43:08.583 --> 00:43:11.542
And what happened that day...

00:43:12.000 --> 00:43:13.667
Mummy!

00:43:13.667 --> 00:43:16.875
Mummy! Where did you go?

00:43:16.875 --> 00:43:18.667
Little one.

00:43:18.667 --> 00:43:23.125
I'm busy babysitting.
I wish you could take over.

00:43:23.125 --> 00:43:25.167
Well, that's a good idea.

00:43:25.167 --> 00:43:27.750
Mummy!

00:43:28.750 --> 00:43:32.375
Mummy. Where did you go? I was lonely.

00:43:32.375 --> 00:43:35.958
If you cry for one more second,
I won't sleep with you.

00:43:35.958 --> 00:43:39.792
You'll never leave me again, right?

00:44:09.542 --> 00:44:10.958
What's up, little girl?

00:44:10.958 --> 00:44:15.458
I'm a... I'm a crybaby.

00:44:15.458 --> 00:44:18.875
So my mummy left me.

00:44:18.875 --> 00:44:21.125
Bayonetta's gone?

00:44:21.125 --> 00:44:22.625
She didn't!

00:44:22.625 --> 00:44:26.125
She was serious about me babysitting you?!

00:44:26.625 --> 00:44:30.167
Let's go look for your Mummy together.

00:44:30.167 --> 00:44:32.875
Yes, old guy.

00:44:33.958 --> 00:44:37.292
Listen, I'm not old, okay?

00:44:37.292 --> 00:44:39.083
Yes, old guy.

00:44:40.375 --> 00:44:42.583
Let's get going.

00:44:45.250 --> 00:44:50.833
The two eyes that govern the
world are about to be reunited.

00:44:50.833 --> 00:44:58.375
With the resurrection of the
Creator Jubileus at hand, the angels are restless.

00:44:58.375 --> 00:45:02.458
You will be sacrificed in
order to awaken Left Eye.

00:45:02.458 --> 00:45:05.958
We are in consensus...

00:45:05.958 --> 00:45:10.625
All of this is to fulfill our goal.

00:45:10.625 --> 00:45:16.125
For the Creation of a New World!

00:45:40.417 --> 00:45:42.708
That's a nice car.

00:45:42.708 --> 00:45:45.917
It is a pity it'll end up in the scrapyard.

00:45:55.792 --> 00:45:57.792
What is it?

00:45:57.792 --> 00:46:00.792
What? Something's coming this way?

00:46:02.333 --> 00:46:03.750
Can you see something?

00:46:03.750 --> 00:46:05.042
No.

00:46:46.542 --> 00:46:48.208
They piss me off.

00:46:52.000 --> 00:46:54.333
She put on quite a show.

00:46:55.958 --> 00:46:59.500
Your mummy is easy to follow.

00:46:59.500 --> 00:47:01.208
Yes!

00:47:15.125 --> 00:47:20.417
You've had enough fun. It's my turn now.

00:47:34.000 --> 00:47:35.792
Mmmm.

00:47:35.792 --> 00:47:39.583
Ask me out with a nicer car next time.

00:47:49.000 --> 00:47:54.250
Not again... this is taking its toll on me.

00:47:55.208 --> 00:48:00.167
May my soul reside with the Creator, Jubileus.

00:48:00.875 --> 00:48:04.458
Old guy. We haven't caught up
with Mummy yet, right?

00:48:04.458 --> 00:48:07.292
Nearly there. Be patient.

00:48:07.292 --> 00:48:08.500
Okay.

00:48:08.500 --> 00:48:13.625
Once we see the airport, we'll be
close to the island with the Ithavoll Tower.

00:48:13.625 --> 00:48:15.583
We'll find your mother.

00:48:15.583 --> 00:48:17.625
Really?

00:48:17.625 --> 00:48:19.583
Yeah.

00:48:19.583 --> 00:48:25.750
As long as the airport itself is intact.

00:48:25.750 --> 00:48:27.000
Here's the exit.

00:48:27.000 --> 00:48:28.708
Wow!

00:48:33.917 --> 00:48:36.292
What's going on?

00:48:36.292 --> 00:48:39.875
This is overdoing it,
even by Bayonetta's standards!

00:48:39.875 --> 00:48:42.875
That ghost is big!

00:48:42.875 --> 00:48:45.333
Mummy!

00:48:55.167 --> 00:48:57.125
Retreat! Retreat!

00:49:25.000 --> 00:49:30.208
The more I hunt angels,
the more powerful I feel.

00:49:30.208 --> 00:49:32.875
What a turn on!

00:49:51.125 --> 00:49:53.042
It suits you!

00:50:10.792 --> 00:50:16.417
Damn Bayonetta! If I can't find
transport we're going to be in trouble.

00:50:18.375 --> 00:50:20.833
We're going to escape in that, little girl.

00:50:20.833 --> 00:50:21.833
Wait!

00:50:21.833 --> 00:50:23.292
What is it?

00:50:23.292 --> 00:50:24.417
Put me down.

00:50:24.417 --> 00:50:26.417
You'll get burned.

00:50:27.667 --> 00:50:29.000
Did you see Mummy?

00:50:29.000 --> 00:50:30.500
Ghosts.

00:50:31.750 --> 00:50:33.167
Ghosts?

00:50:33.167 --> 00:50:36.458
Ghosts are coming!!

00:50:36.458 --> 00:50:39.875
Don't be silly. I can't see a thing.

00:50:41.917 --> 00:50:43.958
I smell rosemary.

00:50:43.958 --> 00:50:45.792
Old guy?

00:50:47.708 --> 00:50:51.417
Little girl, your older
brother's eyesight is good.

00:50:51.417 --> 00:50:53.292
It's time to go.

00:50:53.292 --> 00:50:55.083
Put these on!

00:50:56.500 --> 00:50:58.083
Very well.

00:51:05.208 --> 00:51:08.292
What are they? Could they be angels?

00:51:12.250 --> 00:51:14.708
Little girl, is this really happening?

00:51:14.708 --> 00:51:16.292
Whoa!

00:51:19.042 --> 00:51:21.875
Hey, are they really angels?

00:51:21.875 --> 00:51:25.042
They look like monsters.

00:51:42.042 --> 00:51:45.000
You actually chased me here?

00:51:49.292 --> 00:51:50.875
You must be mad.

00:51:50.875 --> 00:51:52.667
Mummy!

00:52:03.500 --> 00:52:06.583
Is that an angel, too?

00:52:06.583 --> 00:52:07.750
Mummy!

00:52:07.750 --> 00:52:09.958
She'll be fine!

00:52:29.833 --> 00:52:34.417
Little girl, is your
mother fighting the monsters?

00:52:34.417 --> 00:52:38.083
Mummy's a witch.
She's strong and protects others.

00:52:38.083 --> 00:52:40.667
A witch... who protects others?

00:52:40.667 --> 00:52:42.500
Yeah, of course!

00:52:43.875 --> 00:52:48.083
I'm going to become a
strong witch to protect Mummy.

00:53:11.125 --> 00:53:15.250
Now, how pretty will the explosion be?

00:53:35.458 --> 00:53:39.583
Great! Mummy beat the ghosts!

00:53:39.875 --> 00:53:42.458
Take these back.

00:53:42.458 --> 00:53:43.750
What?

00:53:44.750 --> 00:53:47.667
Are they magic glasses?

00:53:47.667 --> 00:53:48.792
No.

00:53:48.792 --> 00:53:51.750
You can see ghosts
without glasses, you know.

00:53:59.417 --> 00:54:04.833
Angels? But I can still smell her.

00:54:10.875 --> 00:54:12.708
Mummy!

00:54:15.333 --> 00:54:18.542
Little one... are you crying?

00:54:18.542 --> 00:54:20.167
No, I'm not!

00:54:20.167 --> 00:54:22.042
Good.

00:54:22.042 --> 00:54:26.917
I wanted you to babysit her at home.

00:54:26.917 --> 00:54:28.458
Luka.

00:54:29.167 --> 00:54:31.417
How many times have I told you?

00:54:31.417 --> 00:54:35.500
I'm not Luka. I'm Cheshire!

00:54:35.500 --> 00:54:38.625
Will you stop taking the piss?

00:54:39.625 --> 00:54:41.417
This is Cheshire.

00:54:41.417 --> 00:54:43.125
What?

00:54:49.333 --> 00:54:53.958
Will you take us to the
Ithavoll Tower? Cheshire...

00:54:57.083 --> 00:55:01.917
You're in luck. That's just
where this helicopter is headed.

00:55:01.917 --> 00:55:05.542
I'm seeing this through to the end.

00:55:08.708 --> 00:55:11.542
The Umbra witch...

00:55:11.542 --> 00:55:19.458
...possesses the outstanding
power the sage spoke of.

00:55:19.458 --> 00:55:24.917
The two eyes of darkness and light...

00:55:24.917 --> 00:55:28.833
...that observed this world for many years.

00:55:28.833 --> 00:55:32.958
The Creation of a New World is here.

00:55:32.958 --> 00:55:38.542
Umbra witch, receive the blessings of Jubileus.

00:55:45.750 --> 00:55:47.042
Here we are!!

00:55:50.542 --> 00:55:55.125
It's good to see you, my dear.

00:55:55.125 --> 00:55:58.125
The hardship is nearly over.

00:55:58.125 --> 00:56:04.500
The signpost to your lost memory is waiting.

00:56:04.500 --> 00:56:10.625
Give me everything you've got. Everything...

00:56:30.542 --> 00:56:31.875
Damn!

00:56:36.833 --> 00:56:38.750
It's on our tail!

00:56:43.750 --> 00:56:45.917
Oh! We're safe?

00:56:46.667 --> 00:56:48.042
Where's Bayonetta?

00:57:01.208 --> 00:57:05.208
You're late. I've been waiting.

00:57:05.208 --> 00:57:09.792
I hope you're going to entertain me this time.

00:57:10.375 --> 00:57:12.625
You'll find out soon.

00:57:12.625 --> 00:57:18.208
This time, I'll make you
spill everything you know.

00:57:19.583 --> 00:57:23.083
Do your best... if you can.

00:57:38.458 --> 00:57:40.958
Isn't it a shame that you have
to fight with such a crappy weapon!

00:57:54.458 --> 00:57:57.375
I can still sense your fear.

00:57:57.375 --> 00:57:59.125
Fear?

00:57:59.125 --> 00:58:01.750
Your memory will make things clear.

00:58:01.750 --> 00:58:06.292
You instinctively fear the fate that you bear.

00:58:07.667 --> 00:58:12.792
"The intersection of light and
dark would bring calamity to this earth."

00:58:12.792 --> 00:58:15.042
It's an ancient saying.

00:58:15.042 --> 00:58:20.042
The calamity resulted in the
downfall of the witches and the sages.

00:58:20.042 --> 00:58:23.083
The effects can be felt even now...

00:58:23.083 --> 00:58:27.792
...centered around you, the forbidden child.

00:58:27.792 --> 00:58:33.708
Put simply, the Creator's power
is known as the Eyes of the World.

00:58:33.708 --> 00:58:39.542
You possess half of the power...
the power of Left Eye.

00:58:45.083 --> 00:58:46.833
Intruder...

00:58:54.667 --> 00:58:55.958
Where am I?

00:58:55.958 --> 00:58:58.500
I've been waiting, Left Eye.

00:59:00.458 --> 00:59:02.167
Witch Jeanne...

00:59:02.167 --> 00:59:07.083
Hindering the coming of the
Creator Jubileus will not be permitted.

00:59:07.083 --> 00:59:11.458
You think an angel has the
right to order a witch around?

00:59:12.458 --> 00:59:13.792
Beat it.

00:59:16.917 --> 00:59:19.667
Foolish one.

00:59:19.667 --> 00:59:24.792
Left Eye, I'll be waiting
by the side of my Lord.

00:59:38.208 --> 00:59:41.500
Well, this looks like a fun place!

00:59:41.500 --> 00:59:44.542
More entertaining than your bar.

00:59:49.333 --> 00:59:54.208
How many times do I have to say?
I'm not who you're looking for.

01:00:03.625 --> 01:00:07.750
Sorry to keep you waiting. Here are your guns.

01:00:09.375 --> 01:00:12.958
I hope they'll satisfy me this time.

01:00:12.958 --> 01:00:15.125
And more to boot.

01:00:23.250 --> 01:00:27.708
Scarborough Fair. Your new Knight.

01:00:27.708 --> 01:00:30.292
It's had a radical transformation.

01:00:44.500 --> 01:00:46.792
See you in the bar.

01:00:47.458 --> 01:00:50.083
If I ever miss the boredom...

01:00:50.750 --> 01:00:54.708
We seem to be on an equal footing now.

01:00:54.708 --> 01:00:58.750
That's right. I'll try to be gentle with you.

01:00:58.750 --> 01:01:05.208
Let's be clear, if you lose to me,
that girl of yours will disappear.

01:01:22.917 --> 01:01:25.083
That's it! That's the idea!

01:01:25.542 --> 01:01:27.167
I remember...

01:01:30.833 --> 01:01:33.875
Jeanne, in accordance with witch law,

01:01:33.875 --> 01:01:37.417
we will now test your worthiness
to be one of our greatest warriors.

01:01:38.042 --> 01:01:40.500
Choose an opponent.

01:01:41.208 --> 01:01:43.125
I'll take the outcast.

01:01:44.667 --> 01:01:46.292
That is not permitted!

01:01:46.292 --> 01:01:51.583
It is not allowed to engage with
the one cursed with tainted blood.

01:01:56.250 --> 01:02:00.292
I remember... I've been here before.

01:02:02.125 --> 01:02:05.417
At last! Let the memories return!

01:02:11.708 --> 01:02:14.750
Your memory... do you fear it?

01:02:43.125 --> 01:02:47.875
Can you feel your strength
increase as your memory returns?

01:02:47.875 --> 01:02:52.167
It is the mission of us
witches to protect Left Eye.

01:02:52.167 --> 01:02:56.167
Even if the forbidden child possesses it.

01:02:56.167 --> 01:02:58.208
Us witches?

01:03:51.708 --> 01:03:54.333
Mama. Mama.

01:04:02.375 --> 01:04:07.500
The Left Eye of the witches is ours now.

01:04:08.458 --> 01:04:10.542
Left Eye...

01:04:10.917 --> 01:04:16.375
Let us seek out the Creator Jubileus.

01:04:18.667 --> 01:04:21.750
The greatest treasure of my clan, "Left Eye"...

01:04:21.750 --> 01:04:24.042
I will not hand it over!

01:04:42.917 --> 01:04:47.542
Jeanne, you saved me.

01:04:57.083 --> 01:05:00.792
When you lost your mother,
you also lost the will to fight.

01:05:00.792 --> 01:05:05.042
It was the only thing
I could do to protect Left Eye.

01:05:06.833 --> 01:05:10.875
We were lucky to have had an innocent childhood.

01:05:10.875 --> 01:05:13.125
Yes...

01:05:14.458 --> 01:05:18.833
You were my only friend...

01:05:20.917 --> 01:05:24.417
And that silly doll of yours.

01:05:27.125 --> 01:05:29.167
Jeanne...

01:05:29.167 --> 01:05:34.250
500 years ago... why did you choose me?

01:05:34.250 --> 01:05:37.542
Everyone hated me.

01:05:37.542 --> 01:05:43.833
To become one of the most powerful witches,
I had to defeat the strongest opponent.

01:05:43.833 --> 01:05:45.542
That's all.

01:05:46.625 --> 01:05:50.625
You cannot run from the sage Balder.

01:05:50.625 --> 01:05:53.667
Bring an end to it all.

01:05:53.667 --> 01:05:57.250
That's your destiny.

01:05:57.250 --> 01:06:02.125
Fight, win and create a new path.

01:06:02.125 --> 01:06:05.042
You can do it!

01:06:12.042 --> 01:06:13.542
Jeanne!

01:06:24.250 --> 01:06:25.500
Jeanne.

01:06:28.167 --> 01:06:29.500
Mummy!

01:06:31.250 --> 01:06:35.958
Got here without any fuss.
Seems like I'm a guest, too.

01:06:37.875 --> 01:06:39.542
Mummy...?

01:06:40.167 --> 01:06:44.542
Little one, what's your greatest treasure?

01:06:44.542 --> 01:06:46.042
Cheshire?

01:06:46.042 --> 01:06:47.000
No.

01:06:47.000 --> 01:06:48.833
Cheshire's a friend.

01:06:50.542 --> 01:06:52.792
This is my greatest treasure.

01:06:56.333 --> 01:07:01.000
You should never let a treasure go.

01:07:01.000 --> 01:07:03.917
Whatever happens.

01:07:03.917 --> 01:07:06.917
I know! I won't cry any more.

01:07:06.917 --> 01:07:11.542
I want to be like you.
You never run away from anything!

01:07:11.542 --> 01:07:13.458
I'm gonna try hard.

01:07:20.333 --> 01:07:22.417
You're not going on your own?

01:07:23.792 --> 01:07:26.208
You'll tag along anyway, right?

01:07:26.208 --> 01:07:28.083
Right?

01:07:42.667 --> 01:07:47.958
It's as if we're being asked inside.
That's very generous.

01:07:47.958 --> 01:07:50.917
My darling daughter...

01:07:50.917 --> 01:07:55.250
It's time to open the "Eyes of the World."

01:07:55.250 --> 01:07:58.125
It's Daddy! Daddy's voice!

01:07:58.125 --> 01:07:59.750
Wait!

01:07:59.750 --> 01:08:01.292
It's Daddy!

01:08:01.292 --> 01:08:02.917
This way!

01:08:02.917 --> 01:08:04.333
Little one...

01:08:12.458 --> 01:08:16.125
Mummy! Mummy's here too, Daddy!

01:08:18.292 --> 01:08:24.167
I've waited a long time for this family reunion.

01:08:25.625 --> 01:08:27.583
Save him...

01:08:29.375 --> 01:08:32.042
Did you have a good journey?

01:08:32.042 --> 01:08:35.667
Yes. Mummy's very strong!

01:08:35.667 --> 01:08:37.167
I see...

01:08:37.167 --> 01:08:42.208
I was scared of the ghosts,
but Mummy told me not to cry.

01:08:42.208 --> 01:08:44.667
You've grown strong, Cereza.

01:08:44.667 --> 01:08:46.042
Yes!

01:08:46.875 --> 01:08:49.708
Today you must sleep in your own room.

01:08:49.708 --> 01:08:54.792
But I don't want to.
There's so much I want to tell you.

01:08:57.167 --> 01:09:00.333
You can tell me tomorrow.

01:09:00.333 --> 01:09:03.125
Oh... okay.

01:09:03.125 --> 01:09:05.083
Good girl.

01:09:07.500 --> 01:09:09.792
Sweet dreams!

01:09:09.792 --> 01:09:12.458
Yes... good night.

01:09:17.792 --> 01:09:19.333
Mummy...

01:09:20.125 --> 01:09:23.917
It's okay... I won't cry
anymore, even if I'm alone.

01:09:25.083 --> 01:09:27.167
Clever girl.

01:09:27.167 --> 01:09:29.417
Good night, Mummy.

01:09:35.083 --> 01:09:38.083
How did you bring me from the past?

01:09:38.083 --> 01:09:40.875
The past... what?

01:09:41.708 --> 01:09:47.500
I opened the door of space-time distorted
by the influence of Jubileus's coming.

01:09:47.500 --> 01:09:54.542
I wanted you to see this foolish
world through innocent, untainted eyes.

01:09:54.542 --> 01:09:57.542
So this man is...?

01:09:57.542 --> 01:10:00.667
The last surviving Lumen Sage.

01:10:00.667 --> 01:10:04.125
The cause of everything. And...

01:10:04.125 --> 01:10:08.750
...little one's... no, my Daddy.

01:10:10.458 --> 01:10:14.750
I've been waiting 500 years...

01:10:15.458 --> 01:10:19.083
...for a chance to purge the chaotic worlds...

01:10:19.083 --> 01:10:22.125
...of heaven, hell and the human world...

01:10:22.125 --> 01:10:28.750
With the resurrection of Jubileus,
the three worlds will become void and be reborn.

01:10:28.750 --> 01:10:35.083
Cereza, you and I will
become gods of this new world!

01:10:36.958 --> 01:10:40.792
Leave it to the leader of the Ithavoll Group.

01:10:40.792 --> 01:10:44.375
You're the master of blowing your own horn.

01:10:44.375 --> 01:10:48.167
But it's not enough to make the headlines.

01:10:48.167 --> 01:10:50.583
You're Luka, right?

01:10:50.583 --> 01:10:53.708
I've been watching your progress.

01:10:53.708 --> 01:10:57.792
Like your father,
you've become a great journalist.

01:10:57.792 --> 01:10:59.792
You knew my father?

01:10:59.792 --> 01:11:03.792
He did some good
investigative work on my plan...

01:11:03.792 --> 01:11:07.875
Everything was fine until he found Cereza...

01:11:07.875 --> 01:11:11.833
...but he was a little too ambitious.

01:11:12.833 --> 01:11:14.542
Wh... What are you doing?

01:11:15.750 --> 01:11:17.917
The scent of rosemary...

01:11:17.917 --> 01:11:21.250
That's the scent... I remember from that day.

01:11:33.583 --> 01:11:37.083
I see it now... it was you...

01:11:37.083 --> 01:11:38.583
Your angels killed my father...

01:11:38.583 --> 01:11:43.292
My condolences on your loss.

01:11:44.417 --> 01:11:48.958
Bayonetta, please forgive me.

01:11:49.583 --> 01:11:51.542
Never mind that.

01:11:52.833 --> 01:11:58.917
Well, even that little crybaby
decided never to cry again.

01:11:58.917 --> 01:12:03.375
So it's time for me to man up
and bring everything to an end!

01:12:04.625 --> 01:12:10.083
Such crude methods for a journalist.

01:12:13.833 --> 01:12:14.917
Luka!

01:12:20.500 --> 01:12:24.375
Cereza, the journey ends here.

01:12:25.125 --> 01:12:30.375
I don't understand.
Why did you summon the younger me?

01:12:30.375 --> 01:12:33.875
Why bother with such
convoluted plans to bring me here?

01:12:35.292 --> 01:12:39.417
You lost your memory completely...

01:12:39.417 --> 01:12:44.583
In order to open Left Eye, you must
reclaim your power, your experience,

01:12:44.583 --> 01:12:48.667
and your love.

01:12:49.375 --> 01:12:53.000
Not only did you try to
throw the world into chaos...

01:12:53.000 --> 01:12:57.083
...but you killed Mama.
What do you know of love?

01:12:57.083 --> 01:13:00.375
It wasn't me who killed Rosa.

01:13:00.375 --> 01:13:03.250
The distortion of the world tore us apart.

01:13:03.250 --> 01:13:08.667
Angels anxious for the resurrection killed her.

01:13:08.667 --> 01:13:15.500
The angels chose to fight you and became
sacrifices to enhance your magic powers.

01:13:15.500 --> 01:13:18.500
Jeanne was the final ingredient.

01:13:18.500 --> 01:13:23.792
She unleashed your full power
and regained the core of you.

01:13:23.792 --> 01:13:27.458
Your memory, in other words.

01:13:27.458 --> 01:13:31.000
Jeanne did very well.

01:13:35.500 --> 01:13:37.292
You're crazy.

01:13:37.792 --> 01:13:39.792
I beg to differ.

01:13:39.792 --> 01:13:44.833
It is not me who's crazy, it's the world itself.

01:13:47.083 --> 01:13:49.625
Can you really shoot me?

01:13:51.500 --> 01:13:54.208
You don't think I can?

01:13:54.208 --> 01:13:58.333
You're going to shoot me? Your father?

01:14:00.542 --> 01:14:05.833
My dearest daughter, Cereza.

01:14:14.750 --> 01:14:21.083
Let's hail the dawning of
a new order and a new world.

01:15:02.708 --> 01:15:06.542
The rebirth of the Creator?
You must be kidding...

01:15:18.333 --> 01:15:24.958
Jubileus... walk with us!

01:15:33.333 --> 01:15:37.625
We must become one with Jubileus.

01:15:59.000 --> 01:16:03.000
The time has come at last.

01:16:03.542 --> 01:16:08.625
We will become the Creator of a New World.

01:16:24.958 --> 01:16:27.458
Don't tell me that's Jubileus?!

01:16:27.458 --> 01:16:29.083
Bayonetta!

01:16:37.125 --> 01:16:39.042
It's wonderful!

01:16:39.042 --> 01:16:45.417
My daughter, this is the
beginning of the new world.

01:16:48.917 --> 01:16:50.583
Cereza...

01:16:51.292 --> 01:16:52.708
Mama...?

01:16:54.042 --> 01:16:58.167
Please... save him...

01:16:58.167 --> 01:17:02.917
His soul is trapped in madness.

01:17:03.792 --> 01:17:06.042
Save him...

01:17:11.042 --> 01:17:14.583
Yes, Mama...

01:17:14.583 --> 01:17:19.667
I must do now what I couldn't then.

01:17:31.750 --> 01:17:35.625
Jeanne, you're still alive?

01:17:35.625 --> 01:17:40.375
"The intersection of light and
dark will bring calamity to this earth."

01:17:40.375 --> 01:17:43.750
So it has another meaning.

01:17:43.750 --> 01:17:47.958
--No, this is the real meaning!
--You're too late...

01:17:47.958 --> 01:17:52.958
You are not needed in this new world.

01:17:52.958 --> 01:17:54.833
I'm not?

01:18:02.000 --> 01:18:05.333
Return our greatest treasure to us!

01:18:16.750 --> 01:18:18.375
Jeanne...

01:18:18.375 --> 01:18:20.625
You must open your eyes!

01:18:20.625 --> 01:18:24.167
Finish what started 500 years ago.

01:18:25.917 --> 01:18:29.167
No time to hesitate! Cereza!!

01:18:39.625 --> 01:18:43.083
I certainly need to keep my eye on you!

01:18:43.083 --> 01:18:45.292
You're not dead yet?

01:19:02.417 --> 01:19:05.167
You fools...

01:19:05.167 --> 01:19:12.667
What have you done?!

01:19:36.708 --> 01:19:38.667
A regular pet isn't good enough!

01:19:38.667 --> 01:19:40.875
It would appear so.

01:19:40.875 --> 01:19:44.500
My dear daughter, Cereza.

01:19:44.500 --> 01:19:47.417
How dare you turn a sword on me?

01:19:47.417 --> 01:19:55.833
I won't have it!

01:19:58.708 --> 01:20:01.000
This is celestial power, huh?

01:20:01.000 --> 01:20:04.125
Cereza, you must follow through.

01:20:04.125 --> 01:20:08.458
Of course... but we must do it together.

01:20:08.458 --> 01:20:09.667
What?

01:20:09.667 --> 01:20:11.958
I've got a special weapon.

01:20:15.250 --> 01:20:17.333
Sounds good to me!

01:20:38.250 --> 01:20:43.125
Queen of Inferno, Sheba.
A fitting match for him!

01:20:45.000 --> 01:20:47.583
--Here we go!
--Okay.

01:21:38.500 --> 01:21:41.958
Transform the world...

01:21:41.958 --> 01:21:46.500
There's still time. Open your eyes, Cereza.

01:21:46.500 --> 01:21:50.917
Father? You don't learn, do you?

01:21:50.917 --> 01:21:54.208
Mama was trying to save you.

01:21:54.625 --> 01:21:56.958
Such nonsense.

01:21:56.958 --> 01:22:02.917
The Creation of a
New World will bring true salvation.

01:22:02.917 --> 01:22:05.333
You're such an egoist.

01:22:05.333 --> 01:22:10.792
What's the fun in creating a
world where you get your own way?

01:22:10.792 --> 01:22:13.875
I rather like this chaos.

01:22:27.125 --> 01:22:29.792
You struggle in vain!

01:22:31.833 --> 01:22:35.500
No, <i>you </i>struggle in vain.

01:22:52.417 --> 01:22:54.083
Got it.

01:22:54.083 --> 01:22:56.833
Let's finish it off.

01:23:08.417 --> 01:23:11.250
I'll feed you all the magic powers.

01:23:19.750 --> 01:23:25.333
Now, understand Mama's feelings.

01:23:26.958 --> 01:23:28.708
Daughter...

01:23:28.708 --> 01:23:34.333
...this lowly world tore Rosa and I apart.

01:23:34.333 --> 01:23:39.000
The world must return to its proper state!

01:23:39.000 --> 01:23:41.625
It must be!

01:23:41.625 --> 01:23:43.750
A pointless wish.

01:23:44.667 --> 01:23:46.708
Mama's waiting.

01:23:49.708 --> 01:23:52.417
Bye... Daddy!

01:24:06.833 --> 01:24:09.708
I love you, Balder.

01:24:12.083 --> 01:24:13.667
Rosa...

01:24:18.958 --> 01:24:22.333
Farewell to the last sage.

01:24:32.083 --> 01:24:33.875
Rosa...

01:25:11.333 --> 01:25:13.083
Bayonetta...

01:25:25.042 --> 01:25:28.625
It's been a year since Bayonetta disappeared.

01:25:28.625 --> 01:25:33.750
I've got all this funeral work
and she's not around to help.

01:25:35.500 --> 01:25:37.708
My business is over.

01:25:37.708 --> 01:25:42.792
Hey, Rodin. Do you think she's gone for good?

01:25:42.792 --> 01:25:48.875
Who's to know? I just help out
people who are looking for weapons.

01:25:48.875 --> 01:25:50.625
That's all.

01:25:50.625 --> 01:25:52.750
If you say so.

01:26:03.625 --> 01:26:07.583
Father... sorry it took so long.

01:26:07.583 --> 01:26:13.958
Although I may have
published it, it's not selling.

01:26:17.917 --> 01:26:21.458
Wonder where she went?

01:26:25.042 --> 01:26:28.417
But we'll meet again, won't we, Bayonetta?

01:26:38.333 --> 01:26:40.208
They're tenacious.

01:26:40.208 --> 01:26:44.042
I should go before the
church becomes a pile of corpses.

01:26:44.042 --> 01:26:46.708
Isn't it ironic that you're a nun!

01:26:46.708 --> 01:26:49.542
It is not as bad as you think.

01:26:49.542 --> 01:26:51.708
You should try it yourself.

01:26:51.708 --> 01:26:55.667
Teaching in high school suits me just fine.

01:26:55.667 --> 01:26:58.042
But before I go home...

01:26:58.750 --> 01:27:03.083
We've got to teach those bad boys a lesson.

01:27:12.458 --> 01:30:27.734
Let's dance, baby!!
